          %h2#idea Idea
          %p
            A variant of the idea of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/generalized+complex+geometry"} generalized complex geometry
            given by passing from generalization of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/complex+geometry"} complex geometry
            to generalization of
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/exceptional+geometry"} exceptional geometry
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/reduction+of+structure+groups"} reduction of structure groups
            along inclusions like
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi O
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mi d
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %mo ×
                  %mi O
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mi d
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %mo →
                  %mi O
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mi d
                  %mo ,
                  %mi d
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} O(d)\times O(d) \to O(d,d)
            it is controled by inclusions into
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/split+real+forms"} split real forms
            of
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/exceptional+Lie+groups"} exceptional Lie groups
          %p
            This serves to neatly encode
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/U-duality"} U-duality
            groups in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/supergravity"} supergravity
            as well as higher
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/supersymmetry"} supersymmetry
            of supergravity
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kaluza-Klein+mechanism"} compactifications
            %em
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/exceptional+field+theory"} exceptional field theory
            for more on this.
          %h2#examples Examples
          %h3#HigherSupersymmetry Higher supersymmetry
          %p
            Compactification of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/11-dimensional+supergravity"} 11-dimensional supergravity
            on a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/manifold"} manifold
            of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/dimension"} dimension
            7 preserves
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi N
                  %mo =
                  %mn 1
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} N = 1
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/supersymmetry"} supersymmetry
            precisely if its
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/generalized+tangent+bundle"} generalized tangent bundle
            has
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/G-structure"} G-structure
            for the inclusion
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi SU
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mn 7
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %mo ↪
                  %msub
                    %mi E
                    %mrow
                      %mn 7
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                      %mn 7
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"}
                  SU(7) \hookrightarrow E_{7(7)}
          %p
            of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/special+unitary+group"} special unitary group
            in dimension 7 into the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/split+real+form"} split real form
            of
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/E7"} E7
            = succeed ")." do
              %a{:href => "#PachecoWaldram08"} Pacheco-Waldram 08
          %p
            One dimension down, compactification of 10-dimensional
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/type+II+supergravity"} type II supergravity
            on a 6-manifold
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi X
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} X
            preserves
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi N
                  %mo =
                  %mn 2
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} N = 2
            supersymmetry precisely if the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/generalized+tangent+bundle"} generalized tangent bundle
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi T
                  %mi X
                  %mo ⊗
                  %msup
                    %mi T
                    %mo *
                  %mi X
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} T X \otimes T^* X
            in the NS-NS sector admits
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/G-structure"} G-structure
            for the inclusion
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi SU
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mn 3
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %mo ×
                  %mi SU
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mn 3
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %mo ↪
                  %mi O
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mn 6
                  %mo ,
                  %mn 6
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %mspace{:width => "thinmathspace"}
                  %mo .
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"}
                  SU(3) \times SU(3) \hookrightarrow O(6,6)
                  \\,.
          %p
            This is reviewed in (
            %a{:href => "#GLSW"}> GLSW, section 2
            ).
